可をいただきたいです。  \n\nまた活動に使用しやすいように、人物と背景のレイヤー分けがされたPSDファイルでの納品をお願いしたいです。  可能でしたら、サイズは16:9の比率でお願いいたします  天癒みるくさん本人からはskebの依頼は許可されています。 ご検討お願いします。  https://lit.link/amaimilknyan\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/live/xPP3uWUL2HU?si=vFuiW7dN8bNYr2Pr", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@HRN__xn/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/11eba7af/uploads/origins/07ce885d-696b-47d6-85cb-222825e57c78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dea5311c3bbb9f72094a83f7cb6bb5b8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/11eba7af/uploads/origins/07ce885d-696b-47d6-85cb-222825e57c78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dea5311c3bbb9f72094a83f7cb6bb5b8, https://si.imgix.net/11eba7af/uploads/origins/07ce885d-696b-47d6-85cb-222825e57c78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d5f86f36dadd39ae78b4ed2a0fd096c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/11eba7af/uploads/origins/07ce885d-696b-47d6-85cb-222825e57c78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=246a924597e49099f6efae6e5c2d245e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I really like your art! I was wondering if you would be able to draw my OC, SnowyWingz. I would like her to perform singing on a stage, similiar to how you have drawn this : https://skeb.jp/@HRN__xn/works/12. \nIf it's okay, could you also draw her nine-tailed fox familiar performing with her too and her fox mask located on her right side of her head. \n\nThe idol clothings (preferably modern and winter theme so light blue/baby blue color) , facial expression and setting is up to you ^^. \n\nPlease draw this in 16:9 format as this would be used for streaming and for social media and also some covers as well (Will credit you too). Please do separate the character and background too.  Thank you and I hope you would consider it!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11UAzkc9bb4_pkgAUg6hxRe-pUY9-2iVm?usp=sharing", "cr